; Tabitha, sketch B "Hot Shuffle": C minor, 108 bpm, swung. A trumpet plays a swaggering shuffle hook over a swung guitar riff, a fuzz-bass shuffle and a backbeat kit. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
